# Godoc

Follow [.cursor/skills/godoc/SKILL.md](../skills/godoc/SKILL.md).

The canonical repository policy is
[CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md#documentation-and-godoc). Every
exported declaration needs lead-name godoc, enforced by golangci-lint revive
and staticcheck. Package overviews belong in `doc.go`.

Browse locally: `go doc github.com/sviatsviatsviat/wat/<package>`
